--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTICE ON CODE REUSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository was created as a consolidation of two earlier internal projects,
which are both proprietary and remain so:

  * Agentic/ticket-system  ("ShopWave CRM")
  * taskmanager/team-task-manager  ("TaskFlow")

No source code has been copied verbatim from either project. The concepts reused
(tenant isolation, RBAC, audit logging, contact/company/lead/deal domain model,
cascading deletes, refresh-token rotation) were reimplemented against the
architecture documented in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, and the security defects
identified in those codebases are catalogued in docs/SECURITY_FINDINGS.md.

Any future port of code from those repositories into this one requires an
explicit written decision recorded in docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md.